  "_sources_comment": "Golden `source` vectors per identity kind: the `source` part of a derived annotation id names the kind of identity that authored it. plugins/uns AnnotationSource derives it again at the executor to prove authorship under an operate grant, and every client that stamps a source must agree with these cases: a person (a JWT or an API key on that person) -> user/<sub>; a Keycloak service account (preferred_username starts with service-account-) -> service/<client-id>; an mTLS service -> service/<service-name>, a case only clients see, since a service never acts through the Edit executor.",
